        <div class="faq-content">
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">If you have a logo, brand guidelines, or existing content, we'll use them. If you don't, we can work with what you have and guide you on what's needed. Content (text, images) for your pages is typically provided by you, though we can advise on structure and messaging.</p>
