        <div class="faq-content">
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Minor changes within the defined scope are handled as part of the project. If you want to add significant new features or change direction substantially, we'll discuss the impact on timeline and cost openly before proceeding. No surprises.</p>
