      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal rd4">
        <button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold">Will I own the code when the project is done?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon w-5 h-5 text-secondary" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes. Once the project is fully paid for, you own the code and all deliverables. We can hand over everything — source code, database schemas, assets — so you're never locked in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item reveal rd5">
        <button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="text-primary text-sm font-semibold">Can you maintain and update the website after launch?</span>
          <svg class="faq-icon w-5 h-5 text-secondary" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10 4v12M4 10h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p class="text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Yes. We offer ongoing maintenance and support — whether that's regular updates, adding new features, fixing issues, or general improvements. We're available long after the initial project is complete.</p>
